 there were some of the  older leaks and rumors that we discussed  already  in our last air pods leak video but  since then  a massive amount of things have changed  so let's get right into it  of course the march event has all but  been confirmed to be happening on the  23rd  so because of that many people are  expecting the airpods 3  to be released at the event however last  month  john prosser said that he's only heard  about ipads and  air tags being released at the march  event so it's possible that airpods  will be released later but then on the  other hand  52 audio started releasing more images  of the new airpods 3  and john prosser ended up saying that  these new leaks are  legitimate and just after that he  tweeted again  now finally adding airpods into the  products that he expects to come at the  event  on the 23rd and just within the last few  days  we started to get some very interesting  leaks and rumors  gizmo china released some brand new  renders of the airpods 3  and they look basically identical to the  ones that 52 audio  previously showed and sam from  appletrack.org  said that the airpods 3 releasing at the  march event is  a safe bet due to all of these leaks  popping up recently  we then got even more images of the  airpods 3 from 52 audio  which are beginning to become much more  convincing  and i now personally believe that these  right here  are 100 legit leaks and they're  exactly what we should expect and this  time around 52 audio added that the  price tag  will most likely be around a hundred and  fifty dollars  which would be awesome since the first  price tag rumor  pointed to a 200 price which was a bit  pricey  for non-pro air pods and then here is  where it got  very exciting the most accurate apple  leaker of all time  kong or king i don't know with a 97.8  percent accuracy rating  said that the new air pods are ready to  ship  and could launch basically anytime this  is so  bullish that it points to them literally  being released  next week at the apple event which is  extremely exciting but wait  don't get too excited because i have  something to admit  so far this entire video has been  the good news and now it's finally time  to get into  the bad news ming chi kuo just came out  with a new report  claiming that airpods 3 mass production  will begin  in quarter 3 of this year which  basically begins  in july yep he's saying that the airpods  3  will not be released at apple's march  events  basically going against everyone else so  yeah  there's definitely some bad news and  what basically makes it even worse  is that he initially thought that they  would launch between april and june  but now they won't even begin production  until july at the soonest  pointing to a launch in the fall but on  the plus side  qo believes that the airpods 3 will be  so good that they'll account  for 40 of the total airpod shipments  in 2021 even with them coming  later now here's what's really weird we  have quo on one side  saying that they won't begin production  until the third quarter of 2021  but at the same time you also have the  absolute most reliable leaker  kong saying that they're ready to ship  right now  so it's definitely a weird situation but  with that said  let me get into when i personally  believe that the airpods 3 are gonna  show up  due to his track record i'd personally  bet on kong being correct  but keep in mind that he didn't say that  they're arriving at the march event  he simply said that they're ready and  then  on top of that it's intriguing that kuo  totally went against kong even though  he's been  so reliable on top of that the fact that  52 audio has been showing  actual photos of the airpods 3 points to  them  actually being ready to go right now and  if you take a look at 52 audio's track  record  they leaked the actual airpods pro at  the beginning of october  in 2019 and then apple officially  released them less than a month later on  october  30th so based on that